{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist FAQ section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: The uploaded screenshot is the exact visual reference. Do not redesign, reinterpret, or introduce a different layout. Reproduce the same two-column structure, typography, colours, spacing, accordion styling, button shapes, and alignment.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width Shopify section.
    
    Background colour: warm pale cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 60px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 75px.
    
    Two-column layout.
    
    Left column: approximately 42% width.
    
    Right column: approximately 58% width.
    
    Column gap: 45px.
    
    Vertically align both columns towards the top.
    
    Premium, minimal, Scandinavian-inspired aesthetic.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    2. LEFT COLUMN – FAQ INTRODUCTION
    
    Create a vertically aligned content block on the left.
    
    Eyebrow text:
    
    "— FAQ"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive (#777D5D).
    
    Small margin below.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Questions?
    We've Got Answers."
    
    Font: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Desktop font size: 38px.
    
    Line height: 1.08.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Maximum width: 400px.
    
    Maintain the exact two-line structure.
    
    Description:
    
    "Can't find what you're looking for? We're happy to help with sizing, orders and returns."
    
    Font: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 13px.
    
    Line height: 1.6.
    
    Colour: muted grey olive (#858575).
    
    Maximum width: 370px.
    
    Margin-top: 16px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 25px., 3. CONTACT BUTTONS
    
    Create two horizontally aligned pill-shaped buttons below the description.
    
    Button 1 – WhatsApp
    
    Text: "Chat on WhatsApp"
    
    Background: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Text colour: white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Small white WhatsApp/chat icon on the left.
    
    Font: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Height: 42px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 20px.
    
    Border radius: 30px.
    
    No heavy shadow.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the store's configurable WhatsApp contact number.
    
    Use a Shopify theme setting for the WhatsApp number.
    
    Open WhatsApp in a new tab.
    
    Use a properly formatted wa.me link.
    
    Button 2 – Email Us
    
    Text: "Email us"
    
    Transparent background.
    
    Thin olive border (#A8AD91).
    
    Dark olive text.
    
    Small envelope icon on the left.
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Height: 42px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 20px.
    
    Border radius: 30px.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the configurable customer support email address using a mailto link.
    
    Button spacing: 10px.
    
    4. RIGHT COLUMN – FAQ ACCORDION
    
    Create exactly SIX accordion items stacked vertically.
    
    The accordion must have the same appearance as the reference screenshot.
    
    ACCORDION STRUCTURE
    
    Each accordion item:
    
    Full available column width.
    
    White background (#FFFFFF).
    
    Border radius: 14px.
    
    No prominent border.
    
    No heavy shadow.
    
    Minimum height when collapsed: 62px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 22px.
    
    Vertical padding: 16px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 9px.
    
    Each question must be left aligned.
    
    Each expand/collapse button must be positioned at the far right.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign whatsapp_number = block.settings.whatsapp_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' | remove: '-' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' %}
{% style %}
  {{ settings.type_body_font | font_face }}
  {{ settings.type_heading_font | font_face }}
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; background:{{ block.settings.background_color }}; padding:75px 60px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:42fr 58fr; gap:45px; align-items:start; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro { min-width:0; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { margin:0 0 13px; color:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:10px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:2px; line-height:1.4; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { max-width:400px; margin:0; color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_heading_font.family }},{{ settings.type_heading_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:38px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.08; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { max-width:370px; margin:16px 0 25px; color:{{ block.settings.description_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { min-height:42px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; padding:0 20px; border:1px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; border-radius:30px; color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.2; text-decoration:none; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--whatsapp { background:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; color:#FFFFFF; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--email { background:transparent; border-color:#A8AD91; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button svg { width:15px; height:15px; flex:0 0 15px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:focus-visible,.ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question:focus-visible { outline:2px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; outline-offset:4px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list { min-width:0; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item { margin-bottom:9px; border-radius:14px; background:#FFFFFF; overflow:hidden; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question { width:100%; min-height:62px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:18px; padding:16px 22px; border:0; background:#FFFFFF; color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; text-align:left; cursor:pointer; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.45; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { flex:0 0 18px; width:18px; height:18px; position:relative; color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::before,.ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { content:''; position:absolute; top:8px; left:3px; width:12px; height:1px; background:currentColor; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { transform:rotate(90deg); }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question[aria-expanded='true'] .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { display:none; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer { padding:0 52px 19px 22px; color:{{ block.settings.description_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:13px; line-height:1.65; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer p { margin:0; }
  @media screen and (max-width:749px) { .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding:48px 22px; } .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width:100%; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:30px; } .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { font-size:32px; } .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question { font-size:13px; } }
{% endstyle %}
<faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">
      <p class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <h2 class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h2>
      <p class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings.description | escape }}</p>
      <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions">
        {% if whatsapp_number != blank %}
          <a class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/{{ whatsapp_number }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Chat on WhatsApp (opens in a new tab)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-12.4 7.4L3 20l1.2-4.4A8.4 8.4 0 1 1 20 11.5Z"/><path d="M8.5 8.5c.4 2.2 2.2 4 4.5 4.5"/></svg>
            <span>Chat on WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.support_email != blank %}
          <a class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--email" href="mailto:{{ block.settings.support_email | escape }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg>
            <span>Email us</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list">
      {% for i in (1..6) %}
        {% liquid
          assign question_key = 'question_' | append: i
          assign answer_key = 'answer_' | append: i
          assign question_text = block.settings[question_key]
          assign answer_text = block.settings[answer_key]
        %}
        {% if question_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item">
            <button class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }}"><span>{{ question_text | escape }}</span><span class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
            <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer" id="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }}" hidden>{{ answer_text }}</div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    (() => {
      class FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
        connectedCallback() {
          this.querySelectorAll('.ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question').forEach((button) => {
            button.addEventListener('click', () => {
              const expanded = button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
              button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
              this.querySelector(`#${button.getAttribute('aria-controls')}`).hidden = expanded;
            });
          });
        }
      }
      const tagName = 'faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
      if (!customElements.get(tagName)) customElements.define(tagName, FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }});
    })();
  </script>
</faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Minimal FAQ",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Introduction" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "— FAQ" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Questions?\nWe've Got Answers." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "description", "label": "Description", "default": "Can't find what you're looking for? We're happy to help with sizing, orders and returns." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "whatsapp_number", "label": "WhatsApp number", "info": "Include country code; formatting characters are removed automatically." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "support_email", "label": "Support email" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "FAQ items" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_1", "label": "Question 1", "default": "How do I choose the right size?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_1", "label": "Answer 1", "default": "<p>Use our size guide to find the best fit for your little one. If you need help, reach out and we’ll be happy to assist.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_2", "label": "Question 2", "default": "What materials are your babywear made from?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_2", "label": "Answer 2", "default": "<p>Our garments are thoughtfully made with soft, comfortable materials selected for everyday wear.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_3", "label": "Question 3", "default": "When will my order ship?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_3", "label": "Answer 3", "default": "<p>Order processing and delivery estimates are shared at checkout and in your order confirmation.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_4", "label": "Question 4", "default": "What is your return policy?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_4", "label": "Answer 4", "default": "<p>Please review our returns page for current eligibility and instructions. Contact us if you have questions.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_5", "label": "Question 5", "default": "Can I change or cancel my order?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_5", "label": "Answer 5", "default": "<p>Contact us as soon as possible after placing your order and we’ll let you know what options are available.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_6", "label": "Question 6", "default": "Do you ship internationally?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_6", "label": "Answer 6", "default": "<p>Available destinations and shipping options are shown during checkout. Contact us if you need assistance.</p>" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colors" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background_color", "label": "Background", "default": "#F5F3E7" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "heading_color", "label": "Heading", "default": "#626B4C" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "eyebrow_color", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "#777D5D" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "description_color", "label": "Body text", "default": "#666657" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Minimal FAQ" }],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "minimal-faq-block"
}
{% endschema %}